! XRT-14 INET(IOL 17.15)= インターネット役(AS 64500)。203.0.113.0/24 と既定経路を XR01 へ広告(トランジット)。
! 試験用の送信元= Lo66 203.0.113.66(攻撃元・M12-5)・Lo77 203.0.113.77(採点が起点に足す攻撃元・M12-5)・
!   Lo97 198.51.100.200(マルチホームのお客さまの番号= インターネット経由で戻る通信・M12-4)・Lo98 100.64.0.98(どこにも経路のない番号・M12-4)。
! 10.0.0.0/8 → XR01 の静的経路= SP の基盤のアドレスを外から狙う通信の試験用(M12-4)。
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to XR01 (SP AS 65000)
 ip address 10.0.100.100 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface Loopback0
 description internet
 ip address 203.0.113.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface Loopback66
 description attacker
 ip address 203.0.113.66 255.255.255.255
!
interface Loopback77
 description another attacker
 ip address 203.0.113.77 255.255.255.255
!
interface Loopback97
 description multihomed customer of the SP (returns over the internet)
 ip address 198.51.100.200 255.255.255.255
!
interface Loopback98
 description unrouted source
 ip address 100.64.0.98 255.255.255.255
!
ip route 10.0.0.0 255.0.0.0 10.0.100.1
!
router bgp 64500
 bgp router-id 203.0.113.1
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 neighbor 10.0.100.1 remote-as 65000
 !
 address-family ipv4
  network 203.0.113.0 mask 255.255.255.0
  neighbor 10.0.100.1 activate
  neighbor 10.0.100.1 default-originate
 exit-address-family
!
